WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.306
This tutorial shows how to create a shift
and offer it to staff in one step, using

2
00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:09.112
fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:11.610
On Shifts, select New shift.

4
00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:15.943
Choose the venue and the role. The address
fills in from the venue.

5
00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:20.147
Set the date, the start and end times, and
the break.

6
00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:27.377
Select staff to open the Select Staff
page. Tick the people to offer the shift

7
00:00:27.377 --> 00:00:28.888
to, then select Confirm.

8
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:34.649
Select Send Offer. Crewflow creates the
shift and sends an offer to each person.

9
00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:39.350
The result lists every offer that was
sent, and explains any person who could

10
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.708
not be offered the shift.
